  "body": "All PHOTOS WERE TAKEN FROM THE SHOWROOM (3 Trafalgar Road).\r\n\r\nPositioned in a quiet cul-de-sac and moments from everything Milford is loved for, these premium new build homes are proving incredibly popular.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Milford Village, Milford Beach, the Marina, North Shore Hospital, Smales Farm Business Park, and excellent motorway and public transport connections, this FREEHOLD and STANDALONE residence delivers the perfect balance of luxury, convenience, and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed and beautifully finished, this newly completed home offers light filled open plan living with soaring ceilings, expansive glazing, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow. Upstairs, three generous bedrooms, two beautifully appointed bathrooms, and a dedicated study nook provide flexibility for families, professionals, or those working from home. Built to a level rarely seen in today's townhouse market, every detail has been carefully considered, with premium materials and designer finishes throughout. \r\n\r\nWhether you're a professional, downsizer, or family searching for a high-quality home in one of the North Shore's most sought-after suburbs, this is an opportunity not to be missed.",
